%% Agent execution flow (high level)
flowchart LR
    A[Parse intent] --> B[Build plan]
    B --> C[Search adapters]
    C --> D[Validate + normalize]
    D --> E[Rank per item]
    E --> F[Optimize basket]
    F --> G{Within hard budget?}
    G -- no --> H[USER_REVIEW_REQUIRED]
    G -- yes --> I[Build cart + verify]
    I --> J[Extract checkout total]
    J --> K{Budget re-guard}
    K -- fail --> H
    K -- pass --> L{Payment policy}
    L -- require user --> M[PAYMENT_AUTH_REQUIRED]
    L -- auto --> N[Authorize + capture]
    N --> O[Place + verify order]
    O --> P[COMPLETED]
